<title>FINLAND: RUOKATALO SEEKS LISTING FOR 10-YR BOND.</title>
<headline>RUOKATALO SEEKS LISTING FOR 10-YR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK-Ruokatalo Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it would seek a bourse listing for its 62.5 million markka 10-year bond.</p>
<p>The subscription period ended on January 30 and the bond was fully subscribed, Ruokatalo said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
